WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:10.426
Trigonometry connects an angle in a right triangle to its side lengths.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:24.082
Remember SOH, CAH, TOA: sine is opposite over hypotenuse, cosine is adjacent over

00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:30.522
hypotenuse, and tangent is opposite over adjacent.

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:39.778
Name the sides from the angle you are using, then choose the matching ratio.
